[{"title":"太白山人仙游吴越稔矣日者卜居吴兴而婚施氏妻妹予闻之辄诗嘲焉二首 其二","author":"李梦阳","text":"见说仙人萼绿华，麻姑亦降蔡经家。\n即防狮子河中吼，背痒无言爪得爬。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56115,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"云中曲送人十首 其一","author":"李梦阳","text":"壮士驱车出汉关，马头丝络紫金环。\n莽莽黄云迷代北，凄凄白雾满燕山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56116,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"云中曲送人十首 其二","author":"李梦阳","text":"季冬饮马长城窟，沙砾飞扬带白骨。\n榆台岭边闻鬼啼，犹是今年战亡卒。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56117,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"云中曲送人十首 其四","author":"李梦阳","text":"城上黄旗张暮天，元戎宅内鼓阗阗。\n底是邻悲并巷哭，云州明日是新年。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56118,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"云中曲送人十首 其五","author":"李梦阳","text":"紫水东来入黑河，纥干山下雪花多。\n小儿拦街吹箴篥，妇人能唱海西歌。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56119,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"云中曲送人十首 其七","author":"李梦阳","text":"自从虏逼雁门关，汉家四野多空垒。\n行子遥遥看独戍，桑乾水冰暮沙起。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56120,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"云中曲送人十首 其八","author":"李梦阳","text":"黄毛爱子出打围，昏宿李陵古台下。\n忽传风火入边城，城中将军夜秣马。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56121,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"云中曲送人十首 其九","author":"李梦阳","text":"战士黄须立道傍，自言曾射左贤王。\n可怜孤绩无人论，赠与青裘白马郎。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56122,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"云中曲送人十首 其十","author":"李梦阳","text":"北风吹日马毛僵，腰间角弓不可张。\n逢君莫唱云中曲，腊月云中更断肠。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56123,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对菊怀邻菊子三首 其一","author":"李梦阳","text":"旧种寒株傍吹台，重阳今岁不曾开。\n遥思烂熳还怜汝，欲比馨香恐见猜。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56124,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对菊怀邻菊子三首 其二","author":"李梦阳","text":"睡起今晨看菊花，霜枝冷蕊忽参差。\n非时未必输桃李，三径遥怜是一家。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56125,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"对菊怀邻菊子三首 其三","author":"李梦阳","text":"尔家堂阁皆邻菊，秋玉满地黄金钱。\n不信菊州能暑热，直将花蕊破霜天。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56126,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送吴生","author":"李梦阳","text":"吴子乘春东入吴，飞花献舞鸟提壶。\n此去嘱君多载酒，直收春色过西湖。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56127,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"东园赠鲍演","author":"李梦阳","text":"修竹南窗花北窗，翠阴浓色两无双。\n隔城走马催银烛，今夜留君倒玉釭。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56128,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日东庄要杭子","author":"李梦阳","text":"白首春风独种瓜，故人常恨隔天涯。\n今游莫惮骝行远，十里柴门有杏花。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56129,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"柬双溪方伯","author":"李梦阳","text":"十旬不见双溪子，白昼看松只自眠。\n君对紫薇谁是伴，相逢还似未逢前。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56130,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人之南郡三首 其一","author":"李梦阳","text":"梁园千古见风流，醉上任楼复谢楼。\n相遇片言心便倒，腰间含笑解吴钩。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56131,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人之南郡三首 其二","author":"李梦阳","text":"鼓刀朱亥本微寒，白首侯嬴是抱关。\n不为千金增意气，秪缘一诺万丘山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56132,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"送人之南郡三首 其三","author":"李梦阳","text":"南阳帝里近亲多，冈势盘龙绕白河。\n便欲临分留宝剑，方城汉水待鸣珂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56133,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陶子见过草亭遂以留云名之大书刻木我亭增色爰赋二诗酬陶亦兼自意 其一","author":"李梦阳","text":"小构茅亭傍一松，云来云去寂无踪。\n晴天户牖濛濛湿，遂使人疑有卧龙。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56134,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"陶子见过草亭遂以留云名之大书刻木我亭增色爰赋二诗酬陶亦兼自意 其二","author":"李梦阳","text":"茅亭自得陶公笔，尽日光芒动白虹。\n山泽不烦通地气，片云时起墨花中。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56135,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"春日宴豫斋王子之第二首 其二","author":"李梦阳","text":"回廊曲榭称春游，绿酒红花白玉瓯。\n借取游丝系西日，晚风吾上海棠楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56136,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"要谢宪使南庄泛舟","author":"李梦阳","text":"柳坞荷塘野意宽，操舟曳杖独游难。\n春来欲制东山屐，倘许花樽共谢安。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56137,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"江上逢郑南溟","author":"李梦阳","text":"杨子湾头红蓼秋，水边楼阁树边舟。\n一日长风破万里，为君三醉过瓜州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56138,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"经行塞上二首 其一","author":"李梦阳","text":"山作垣篱海作池，弯弓百万羽林儿。\n桑乾化作银河水，北极光芒夜夜垂。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56139,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"归途览咏古迹并追记百泉游事八首 其一","author":"李梦阳","text":"太行王屋是天关，吐出风云天地间。\n河内休誇盘谷胜，共城亦有石门山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56140,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"归途览咏古迹并追记百泉游事八首 其二","author":"李梦阳","text":"华山中断浊河开，浪打雷门势莫回。\n巳铲潼关为汉垒，更分仙掌作秦台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56141,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"归途览咏古迹并追记百泉游事八首 其三","author":"李梦阳","text":"雷首千峰锦削成，蛇盘千里翠云生。\n即从北岳分明去，便压辽阳跨海行。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56142,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"归途览咏古迹并追记百泉游事八首 其四","author":"李梦阳","text":"西山西望自堪愁，耐可源泉向北流。\n不见玉台歌舞处，可怜昔日帝王州。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56143,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"归途览咏古迹并追记百泉游事八首 其五","author":"李梦阳","text":"昔日武王东阅师，龙争虎斗至今悲。\n漂自化为商地水，白云翻作孟津旗。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56144,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"归途览咏古迹并追记百泉游事八首 其六","author":"李梦阳","text":"淇门不减越江头，卫女宁论越女游。\n濮上春花如锦绣，桑中五月采莲舟。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56145,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"归途览咏古迹并追记百泉游事八首 其七","author":"李梦阳","text":"河济谁言不共流，青春恶浪古怀州。\n荡摇少室三花树，倒映天坛白石楼。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56146,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"归途览咏古迹并追记百泉游事八首 其八","author":"李梦阳","text":"袅袅丹崖倒碧松，悬泉一道挂飞龙。\n闲磨石镜惊山鸟，映出青天对雪峰。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56147,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望上清山三首 其一","author":"李梦阳","text":"赤城龙虎紫云盘，白石楼台北斗坛。\n闻道仙床啼玉女，欲从何处问金丹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56148,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望上清山三首 其二","author":"李梦阳","text":"碧山新起赤霞宫，玉带真人晓御风。\n金检奏回天一笑，九霄来往鹤如虹。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56149,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望上清山三首 其三","author":"李梦阳","text":"星妃云君云雾鬟，何事应游栖碧山。\n昨夜升天朝北斗，佩环清响落人间。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56150,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"望龟峰","author":"李梦阳","text":"曾会汪家贤弟兄，三年独见忽心惊。\n顺风斜日飞帆度，三十六峰无限情。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56151,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"杜峰歌","author":"李梦阳","text":"杜山曾有凤来鸣，凤舞山青海月明。\n传道有人回峰去，九天风散玉箫声。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56152,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"舟次石头口","author":"李梦阳","text":"窗开面面水风微，五月江空冷照衣。\n此艇果如天上坐，茶烟化作綵云飞。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56153,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登啸台三首 其一","author":"李梦阳","text":"阳翟看山二月回，蓬池登啸九天开。\n晚立长风摇海色，东西日月照孤台。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56154,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登啸台三首 其二","author":"李梦阳","text":"万古春城碧草还，苍台只在白云间。\n竹林北望风烟动，寂寞苏门更见山。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56155,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"登啸台三首 其三","author":"李梦阳","text":"白日红云拂地流，醉乡吾亦步兵游。\n登台左盻黄河转，绿水洪波不尽愁。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer":56156,"sha256":"0e5ded52c96c8e34ab2eff2ca89a15a7de75b039194ad001baa98286d2e2e10d","dynasty":"明"}},{"title":"夏日阁宴","author":"李梦阳","text":"地旷楼雄夏日宜，碧梯芳树绕花迟。\n清歌不用邀明月，一笑山河入酒卮。","collection":"明","notice":"","provenance":{"repo":"Werneror/Poetry","commit":"4cfe49c06858e00d15f84d192fe5294295f79689","path":"明_1.csv","pointer"